$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 1-Fluoro-4-methylsulfonylbenzene (1) A mixture of 4-(methylsufonyl)phenol
(88.8 mg, 0.500 mmol) and PhenoFluorMix (1.10 g) in toluene (5.0 mL) was
stirred at 23°C for 30 min, then at 110°C for 24 hours. Purification by
flash silica gel column chromatography (EtOAc in hexanes = 10-30%). 86.4
mg of the title compound as a colorless solid (99% yield). R f = 0.15
(EtOAc in hexanes = 20%). NMR Spectroscopy: 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3, 23°C,
δ): 7.96 (dd, J = 7.4, 5.4 Hz, 2H), 7.24 (t, J = 7.9 Hz, 2H), 3.05 (s,
3H). 13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3, 23°C, δ): 165.9 (d, J = 256.6 Hz), 136.7
(d, J = 3.8 Hz), 130.4 (d, J = 10.5 Hz), 116.8 (d, J =J = 22.9 Hz), 44.8.
19F NMR (470 MHz, CDCl3, 23°C, δ): -106.5. HRMS-FIA(m/z) calc’d for
C7H8FO2S [M+H]+, 175.0224; found, 175.0227.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM PhenoFluorMix: Practical Chemoselective Deoxyfluorination of Phenols
