$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 4-Fluoro-N,N-dimethylbenzamide (2) A mixture of
4-hydroxy-N,N-dimethylbenzamide (84.3 mg, 0.500 mmol) and PhenoFluorMix
(1.10 g) in toluene (5.0 mL) was stirred at 23°C for 30 min, then at
110°C for 24 hours. Purification by flash silica gel column
chromatography (EtOAc in hexanes = 20-50%). 81.1 mg of the title compound
as a colorless solid (97% yield). R f = 0.20 (EtOAc in hexanes = 50%).
NMR Spectroscopy: 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3, 23°C, δ): 7.41 (dd, J = 8.8,
5.4 Hz, 2H), 7.06 (t, J = 8.8 Hz, 2H), 3.08 (br s, 3H), 2.97 (br s, 3H).
13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3, 23°C, δ): 170.8, 163.3 (d, J = 249.9 Hz), 132.4
(d, J = 3.8 Hz), 129.5 (d, J = 8.6 Hz), 115.5 (d, J = 21.9 Hz), 39.7,
35.6. 19F NMR (470 MHz, CDCl3, 23°C, δ): -113.7. HRMS-FIA(m/z) calc’d for
C9H11FNO [M+H]+, 168.0819; found, 168.0832.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM PhenoFluorMix: Practical Chemoselective Deoxyfluorination of Phenols
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Fujimoto, Teppei; Ritter, Tobias
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Letters (2015), 17(3), 544-547

$RFMT $RIREG SCHEME61 STEP1
