$DATUM 1-(4-Fluorophenyl)-1H-imidazole (14) A mixture of 4-(1-imidazolyl)phenol
(82.6 mg, 0.500 mmol) and PhenoFluorMix (1.10 g) in toluene (5.0 mL) was
stirred at 23°C for 30 min, then at 110°C for 24 hours. Purification by
flash silica gel column chromatography (EtOAc in hexanes = 20-80%). 75.5
mg of the title compound as a yellow oil (93% yield). R f = 0.45 (EtOAc =
100%). NMR Spectroscopy: 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3, 23°C, δ): 7.78 (s, 1H),
7.37-7.31 (m, 2H), 7.22-7.13 (m, 4H). 13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3, 23°C, δ):
161.8 (d, J = 247.0 Hz), 135.9, 133.7 (d, J = 3.8 Hz), 130.6, 123.5 (d, J
= 8.6 Hz), 118.6, 116.7 (d, J = 22.9 Hz). 19F NMR (470 MHz, CDCl3, 23°C,
δ): -117.0. HRMS-FIA(m/z) calc’d for C9H8FN2 [M+H]+, 163.0666; found,
163.0673.
