$DATUM 8-Fluoroquinoline (18) A mixture of 8-hydroxyquinoline (73.3 mg, 0.500
mmol) and PhenoFluorMix (1.10 g) in toluene (5.0 mL) was stirred at 23°C
for 30 min, then at 110°C for 24 hours. Purification by flash silica gel
column chromatography (EtOAc in hexanes = 10%-30%). 61.4 mg of the title
compound as a colorless oil (83% yield). R f = 0.26 (EtOAc in hexanes =
30%). NMR Spectroscopy: 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3, 23°C, δ): 8.95 (d, J =
3.9 Hz, 1H), 8.16 (dd, J = 8.3, 1.5 Hz, 1H), 7.58 (d, J = 8.3 Hz, 1H),
7.49-7.41 (m, 2H), 7.38 (t, J = 9.3 Hz, 1H). 13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3,
23°C, δ): 158.1 (d, J = 256.6 Hz), 150.6 (d, J = 1.9 Hz), 138.6 (d, J =
11.5 Hz), 135.9 (d, J = 3.8 Hz), 129.9, 126.5 (d, J = 8.6 Hz), 123.5 (d,
J = 4.8 Hz), 122.1, 113.6 (d, J = 18.1 Hz). 19F NMR (470 MHz, CDCl3,
23°C, δ): - 128.7. HRMS-FIA(m/z) calc’d for C9H7FN [M+H]+, 148.0557;
found, 148.0563.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM PhenoFluorMix: Practical Chemoselective Deoxyfluorination of Phenols
