$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 3-(4-Fluoro-3-methoxyphenyl)-2-propenoic acid ethyl ester (3) A mixture
of ethyl 4-hydroxy-3-methoxycinnamate (111 mg, 0.500 mmol) and
PhenoFluorMix (1.10 g) in toluene (5.0 mL) was stirred at 23°C for 30
min, then at 110°C for 24 hours. Purification by flash silica gel column
chromatography (Et2O in hexanes = 5-10%). 101 mg of the title compound as
a colorless solid (90% yield). R f = 0.14 (Et2O in hexanes = 10%). NMR
Spectroscopy: 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3, 23°C, δ): 7.61 (d, J = 16.1 Hz,
1H), 7.12-7.04 (m, 3H), 6.34 (d, J = 16.1 Hz, 1H), 4.25 (q, J = 7.1 Hz,
2H), 3.91 (s, 3H), 1.33 (q, , J = 7.1 Hz, 3H). 13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3,
23°C, δ): 166.9, 153.8 (d, J = 250.8 Hz), 148.1 (d, J = 10.5 Hz), 143.7,
131.2 (d, J = 3.8 Hz), 121.6 (d, J = 6.7 Hz), 118.2 (d, J = 1.9 Hz),
116.5 (d, J = 19.1 Hz), 112.3 (d, J = 1.9 Hz), 60.7, 56.3, 14.4. 19F NMR
(470 MHz, CDCl3, 23°C, δ): -134.3. HRMS-FIA(m/z) calc’d for C12H14FO3
[M+H]+, 225.0921; found, 225.0926.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM PhenoFluorMix: Practical Chemoselective Deoxyfluorination of Phenols
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Fujimoto, Teppei; Ritter, Tobias
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Letters (2015), 17(3), 544-547

