$DATUM 3-Fluoroestra-1,3,5(10)-trien-17-one (20) A mixture of estrone (135 mg,
0.500 mmol) and PhenoFluorMix (1.10 g) in toluene (5.0 mL) was stirred at
23°C for 30 min, then at 110°C for 24 hours. Purification by flash silica
gel column chromatography (Et2O in hexanes = 5%). 117 mg of the title
compound as a colorless solid (86% yield). R f = 0.31 (EtOAc in hexanes =
10%). NMR Spectroscopy: 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3, 23°C, δ): 7.23 (dd, J =
8.3, 5.8 Hz, 1H), 6.83 (td, J = 8.3, 2.6 Hz, 1H), 6.78 (dd, J = 9.6, 2.6
Hz, 1H), 2.92- 2.86 (m, 2H), 2.51 (dd, J = 19.2, 8.3 Hz, 1H), 2.39 (m,
1H), 2.25 (br t, J = 10.3 Hz, 1H), 2.15 (quin, J = 9.0 Hz, 1H), 2.09-1.93
(m, 3H), 1.67-1.40 (m, 6H), 0.91 (s, 3H). 13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3, 23°C,
δ): 220.8, 161.1 (d, J = 244.2 Hz), 138.8 (d, J = 7.6 Hz), 135.5 (d, J =
2.9 Hz), 126.9 (d, J = 8.6 Hz), 115.2 (d, J = 20.0 Hz), 112.6 (d, J =
21.0 Hz), 50.5, 48.0, 44.1, 38.2, 36.0, 31.7, 29.6, 26.4, 26.0, 21.7,
13.9. 19F NMR (470 MHz, CDCl3, 23°C, δ): -121.1. HRMSFIA( m/z) calc’d for
C18H22FO [M+H]+, 273.1649; found, 273.1652.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
