$DATUM 17-epi-17-Fluoro-17-deoxy-testosterone (3) Under N2 atmosphere, an
oven-dried 20 mL vial was charged with testosterone (100 mg, 0.347 mmol,
1.00 equiv), KF (40.3 mg, 0.693 mmol, 2.00 equiv), and PhenoFluor (222
mg, 0.520 mmol, 1.50 equiv). Toluene (7.0 mL) was added, followed by
N,N-diisopropylethylamine (89.6 mg, 121 μL, 0.693 mmol, 2.00 equiv). The
reaction mixture was stirred in a sealed vial and heated at 80 °C for 15
h. Once cooled to 23 °C, the reaction mixture was concentrated in vacuo.
The residue was purified by chromatography on silica gel, eluting with
hexanes/EtOAc 8:1 (v/v), to afford 88.2 mg of the title compound.
17-epi-17-Fluoro-17-deoxy-testosterone (3), colorless solid (88% yield)
Rf = 0.36 (hexanes/EtOAc 7:1 (v/v)). NMR Spectroscopy: 1H NMR (500 MHz,
CDCl3, 23 °C, δ): 5.75 (s, 1H), 4.54 (dd, J = 55.2, 5.4 Hz, 1H), 2.590.94
(m, 19H), 1.21 (s, 3H), 0.72 (s, 3H). 13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3, 23 °C, δ):
199.6, 171.2, 124.1, 101.0 (d, JCF = 186.8 Hz), 53.7, 48.7, 45.2 (d, JCF
= 18.3 Hz), 38.9, 35.2 (d, JCF = 8.2 Hz), 34.1, 33.0, 32.3, 30.9 (d, JCF
= 5.5 Hz), 30.4, 30.2, 24.4, 20.6, 17.6, 15.5 (d, JCF = 7.3 Hz). 19F NMR
(375 MHz, CDCl3, 23 °C, δ): 173.4. Mass Spectrometry: HRMS (ESI-TOF)
(m/z): Calcd for [C19H27FO + H]+, 291.2119. Found, 291.2119.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Schlenk or glovebox technique used, sealed vial used
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Late-Stage Deoxyfluorination of Alcohols with PhenoFluor
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
