$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 1-Fluoro-4-phenoxybenzene (6) A mixture of 4-phenoxyphenol (94.0 mg,
0.500 mmol) and PhenoFluorMix (1.10 g) in xylene (5.0 mL) was stirred at
23°C for 30 min, then at 140°C for 24 hours. Purification by flash silica
gel column chromatography (Et2O in hexanes = 5%). 82.4 mg of the title
compound as a colorless oil (88% yield). R f = 0.62 (Et2O in hexanes =
10%). NMR Spectroscopy: 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3, 23°C, δ): 7.33 (dd, J =
8.8, 7.3 Hz, 2H), 7.09 (tt, J = 7.3, 1.0 Hz, 1H), 7.06-6.95 (m, 6H). 13C
NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3, 23°C, δ): 158.9 (d, J = 238.4 Hz), 157.8, 153.0,
129.9, 123.3, 120.7 (d, J = 8.6 Hz), 118.4, 116.4 (d, J = 22.9 Hz). 19F
NMR (470 MHz, CDCl3, 23°C, δ): -123.2. HRMS-FIA(m/z) calc’d for C12H10FO
[M+H]+, 189.0710; found, 189.0710.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
